==Battleground==
*1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**6 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threats in here are the [[Le'noir]] and the [[Gory Dark|Dual]] [[Aku Gory|Gories]], so you should bring some anti-[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and/or anti-[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]], or things that attack quickly to juggle the Gories. do take note that the enemies are limited, so once you defeat them all, there are no more threats from then on.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]]: Essentially made to counter to this stage, as he can [[Dodge Attack|dodge]] the attacks of both Dark and Aku enemies.
*[[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]: Stackable, Decently Cheap, Attacks relatively quickly, does solid damage, survives on 1 HP once. Honestly a great cat at knocking back the Gories quickly.
*[[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]]: Helpful to tank hits from the faster Dark enemies.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kuu (Uber Rare Cat)|Kuu]]: Although she may not seem very useful, she can end up helping in this stage, being [[Strong Against]] Darks and outranging [[Le'noir]]. Just make sure that you are careful when using her, as when the enemies are close, especially Aku Gory, she may be completely annihilated, especially with her slow attack speed.
*[[Imagawa Yoshimoto (Uber Rare Cat)|Imagawa Yoshimoto]]: Similar to Kuu, but trading off HP and damage for [[Weaken|weaken]] and [[Long Distance]], so he can hit Le'noir safely. Be wary though, as he also can be demolished by powerful enemies like Aku Gory if they slip into his blindspot.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Jizo's Moving Castle]]: His evolved/true form can easily deal with the Gories and can outrange Le'noir, as well as having [[Massive Damage]] against Dark enemies.

